{
  "name": "ICP 七类文档同义改写回归集",
  "version": "2026-08-28",
  "description": "问题均为针对合成测试资料重新措辞的评测输入，不把原文句子直接当作查询。",
  "defaults": {
    "assertions": {
      "min_evidence": 1,
      "min_citations": 1,
      "required_event_types": ["plan", "tool_call", "answer", "done"],
      "answer_not_contains": [
        "待复核（未绑定已批准直接证据）",
        "证据边界：部分说明未附可直接核验的来源"
      ]
    }
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "external-data-not-delivered",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "short",
          "question": "信息没能送到外接设备，原因可能在哪？"
        },
        {
          "id": "detailed",
          "question": "内部已经产生业务报文，但接在外面的设备始终收不到有效内容，可能经过哪些环节出错？"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "category": "原因分析",
        "expected_records": ["FTA-SYN-003", "FM-SYN-040", "FM-SYN-041", "FM-SYN-042", "FUNC-300"],
        "graph_expected": true
      },
      "assertions": {
        "required_tools": ["fta_query", "fmeca_query", "graph_traversal"],
        "required_doc_types": ["fta", "fmeca"],
        "answer_not_contains": ["BCM", "启动时序超时", "91820001"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "startup-stuck",
      "question": "接通设备后一直停在准备阶段，两路处理单元都没接手业务，可能是哪部分出了问题？",
      "metadata": {
        "category": "现象定位",
        "expected_records": ["FUNC-210", "FM-SYN-016", "FM-SYN-017", "FM-SYN-018", "FTA-SYN-001"],
        "graph_expected": true
      },
      "assertions": {
        "required_tools": ["fta_query", "graph_traversal"],
        "any_doc_types": ["fta", "fmeca", "function_locator"],
        "answer_not_contains": ["唯一可以确定是 BCM"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "psua-hot-dropout",
      "question": "设备在高负荷下热起来以后，主供电分支突然离线，备用分支接管；冷却后主路又可工作。更像哪类故障？",
      "metadata": {
        "category": "现象定位",
        "expected_records": ["FM-SYN-006", "91810002**0003", "MFL-SYN-006", "HIS-SYN-002", "FTA-SYN-005"],
        "graph_expected": true
      },
      "assertions": {
        "required_tools": ["fmeca_query", "graph_traversal"],
        "any_doc_types": ["fmeca", "hmc", "fault_history"],
        "answer_regex": ["热|焊|连接"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "network-burst-loss",
      "question": "网络一忙就有成批报文到不了，业务量降下来又恢复，优先怀疑哪里？",
      "metadata": {
        "category": "现象定位",
        "expected_records": ["FM-SYN-038", "91830003**0002", "MFL-SYN-038", "HIS-SYN-013", "FTA-SYN-003"],
        "graph_expected": true
      },
      "assertions": {
        "required_tools": ["fta_query", "graph_traversal"],
        "any_doc_types": ["fmeca", "fta", "fault_history"],
        "answer_not_contains": ["已经确认网关硬件损坏"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "external-display-blank",
      "question": "内部图像数据仍在更新，外接屏却提示没有输入；换过终端和连接线仍一样，故障可能在哪一段？",
      "metadata": {
        "category": "现象定位",
        "expected_records": ["FM-SYN-049", "91840003**0001", "MFL-SYN-049", "HIS-SYN-017", "FTA-SYN-004"],
